    UiText:
      outlineWidth: 2
      text: 'Fly the lane through the ring of Kael: your ship rides the rail, you steer it inside the frame and aim with the reticles. Shoot the rocks in your way and the squadrons that come at you; a barrel roll turns their shots away. The hull recharges when nothing hits it for a while. Destroy the Warden at the end of the lane. Score, hit ratio and the hull left give a bronze, silver or gold medal.'
